  "contentHtml": "<p>필름통 온도계 탐구활동이 있는데요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>마법의 빨간 용액을 필름통에 넣고,</p><p>뜨거운 물에 넣으면 빨대를 타고 용액이 올라옵니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>왜 그럴까요?&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/674ed8c3ec2910b6d423893f806de0a4a96ee3f3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/674ed8c3ec2910b6d423893f806de0a4a96ee3f3\" data-origin-width=\"482\" data-origin-height=\"445\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/11c3f559835817102b4c6e1e15cdadfc8ade7c57\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/11c3f559835817102b4c6e1e15cdadfc8ade7c57\" data-origin-width=\"1035\" data-origin-height=\"582\"></div><p>학생들이 그 이유에 대해</p><p>가설을 세우고, 가설검증방법을 고안하고,</p><p>교사는 피드백해줍니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e9baba03d8c7c69f0ab512d7346ed98689babb14\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"202\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e9baba03d8c7c69f0ab512d7346ed98689babb14\" data-origin-width=\"1042\" data-origin-height=\"422\"></div><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/FQqVq7yoXQY?si=Bh2FgjyFc1Cr29BA\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/FQqVq7yoXQY?si=Bh2FgjyFc1Cr29BA</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FQqVq7yoXQY\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cz8Rl1/dJMb9b3LOsj/KNCv5n5eB9AgO4SeNLSWb1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=403_97_449_147,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dj8Hsf/dJMb9dHhJT3/Wcbegpgk4QtZfhBPBQvkDK/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=403_97_449_147,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AsIFq/dJMb9cBBPKW/CDEmTee6keXuFSJCX3QPQ0/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=403_97_449_147\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FQqVq7yoXQY\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>----------------------------</p><p>교사의 피드백을</p><p>AI가 대신 해줄 수 있을까요?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>구글 제미나이 Canvas 기능을 활용하여 만들어 보았습니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b98e13df4b52bbddcd1278bb5d6c50172e7804cd\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"508\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b98e13df4b52bbddcd1278bb5d6c50172e7804cd\" data-origin-width=\"883\" data-origin-height=\"550\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>(필름통 온도계 탐구하기)</b></span></p><p><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/16e5a5586779\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/16e5a5586779</a></p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
